{
  "name": "My workflow 3",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🤖 Telegram AI Assistant Workflow\n\n**Overview:**\nThis workflow creates an intelligent Telegram bot that can handle both text and voice messages.\n\n**Process Flow:**\n1. **Telegram Trigger** - Receives incoming messages\n2. **Message Type Detection** - Determines if message is text or voice\n3. **Voice Processing** (if voice) - Downloads and transcribes audio\n4. **AI Agent** - Processes content using LLM and responds intelligently\n5. **Response Delivery** - Sends reply back to Telegram\n\n**Features:**\n- Handles text messages directly\n- Downloads and transcribes voice notes\n- Maintains conversation context with memory\n- Intelligent responses using GPT-4\n- Error handling and fallbacks",
        "height": 540,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -660,
        180
      ],
      "id": "f1e7c9b0-8013-46a5-a330-b72388131dc0",
      "name": "Workflow Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📱 Telegram Input\n\nReceives messages from Telegram bot.\n\n**Setup Required:**\n1. Create bot with @BotFather\n2. Get bot token\n3. Add token to n8n credentials\n4. Set webhook URL in bot settings",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        220
      ],
      "id": "65bf0879-6779-4cb7-b6e2-990350f362f0",
      "name": "Telegram Setup Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
