      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🤖 AI Processing\n\n**LLM Configuration:**\n- Model: GPT-4\n- Context-aware responses\n- Conversation memory\n- Multi-language support\n\n**Tools Available:**\n- Web search capability\n- Calculator for math\n- Memory for context",
